{"id": "3452550715", "title": "快速打造可手机控制的私有 C***X 助手", "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyMDgzMDMyMg==&mid=2247484722&idx=1&sn=6739628ef085005b274c75a24691d92d", "accountName": "RedTeaming", "author": "RedTeaming", "date": "6月4日", "ts": 1780580520000, "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/tYOJfk5kJ67kibPj1rssXLe0rCHSZVXwBuBeMODzgtYDAbyRsrRhjQWiayIToCiaicxx8Dicm47fiaAkTsGuRhahJB9cvBa9rlZuFnzcCMYz1Ieq4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "summary": "原创 XTeam 2026-06-04 21:42 江苏 \n不用云端也能同步！\n前置要求 \nMac （运行桥接服务,安装某X Desktop） \niPhone（安装 remodex ） \nTailscale 已安装并配置好 \n方案一：Mac 作为中继（推荐简单场景） \n1. Mac 上安装 Tailscale \nbrew install tailscale \nsudo  tailscale up ", "content": [{"type": "p", "text": "原创 XTeam 2026-06-04 21:42 江苏"}, {"type": "p", "text": "不用云端也能同步！"}, {"type": "img", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/tYOJfk5kJ67kibPj1rssXLe0rCHSZVXwBuBeMODzgtYDAbyRsrRhjQWiayIToCiaicxx8Dicm47fiaAkTsGuRhahJB9cvBa9rlZuFnzcCMYz1Ieq4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "caption": "", "_imgCount": 1}, {"type": "h", "text": "前置要求"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Mac （运行桥接服务,安装某X Desktop）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "iPhone（安装 remodex ）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Tailscale 已安装并配置好"}, {"type": "h", "text": "方案一：Mac 作为中继（推荐简单场景）"}, {"type": "h", "text": "1. Mac 上安装 Tailscale"}, {"type": "p", "text": "brew install tailscale sudo  tailscale up"}, {"type": "p", "text": "记录你的 Tailscale IP："}, {"type": "p", "text": "tailscale ip -4"}, {"type": "h", "text": "2. Mac 上部署某x"}, {"type": "p", "text": "git  clone   https://github.com/Emanuele-web04/remodex.git cd  remodex ./run-local-remodex.sh --hostname"}, {"type": "h", "text": "3. iPhone 连接"}, {"type": "p", "text": "确保 iPhone 也安装了 Tailscale 并登录同一账号"}, {"type": "p", "text": "打开某remodex"}, {"type": "p", "text": "扫描 Mac 终端显示的 QR Code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "开始使用"}, {"type": "h", "text": "注意事项"}, {"type": "p", "text": "所有设备必须在同一个 Tailscale 网络中"}, {"type": "p", "text": "不要将真实的 Tailscale IP、域名等敏感信息提交到 Git"}, {"type": "p", "text": "如需后台运行，可使用  nohup  或  systemd"}, {"type": "h", "text": "桌面宠物玩法"}, {"type": "p", "text": "下载地址:  https://codex-pets.net/#/?sort=popular"}, {"type": "p", "text": "跳转微信打开"}], "body": null}